{"t":"ACM","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"AECOM","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","employees":52000,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://aecom.com","summary_en":"AECOM, together with its subsidiaries, provides professional infrastructure consulting services for governments, businesses, and organizations internationally. The company operates in three segments: Americas, International, and AECOM Capital. The company offers advisory, planning, consulting, architectural and engineering design, construction and program management services, and investment and development services to public and private clients in major end markets such as transportation, facilities, water, environmental, and energy. It is also involved in the investment and development of real estate projects. The company was formerly known as AECOM Technology Corporation and changed its name to AECOM in January 2015. AECOM was incorporated in 1980 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"AECOM은 자회사와 함께 국제적으로 정부, 기업 및 조직에 전문 인프라 컨설팅 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 미주, 국제 및 AECOM Capital의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 교통, 시설, 물, 환경, 에너지 등 주요 최종 시장의 공공 및 민간 고객에게 자문, 계획, 컨설팅, 건축 및 엔지니어링 설계, 건설 및 프로그램 관리 서비스, 투자 및 개발 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 부동산 프로젝트의 투자 및 개발에도 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 AECOM Technology Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2015년 1월에 이름을 AECOM으로 변경했습니다. AECOM은 1980년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 달라스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":83.93,"mcap":10811028480.0,"pe":29.552818,"fpe":11.85221,"peg":0.4327,"ps":0.7161343,"pb":4.704069,"ev_ebitda":13.614,"div":1.63,"beta":0.904,"hi52":109.0,"lo52":56.39},"fin":{"rev":15096370176.0,"rev_g":-0.071,"eps_g":0.083,"gross":0.05822,"op":0.04919,"net":0.01947,"roe":0.15922,"fcf":501427136.0,"cash":1254606976.0,"debt":3350953984.0,"de":133.877,"eps":2.84,"feps":7.08138},"own":{"short":0.052199997,"inst":0.94602996,"insider":0.00495},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":96.70833,"median":97.0,"high":110.0,"low":86.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.53846,"trend